{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26626","headline":"寄杨茂卿校书 · 姚合","name":"寄杨茂卿校书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年别君时，同宿黎阳城。\n黄河冻欲合，船入冰罅行。\n君爲使滑州，我来西入京。\n丈夫不泣别，旁人叹无情。\n到京就省试，落籍先有名。\n慙辱乡荐书，忽欲自受刑。\n还家岂无路，羞爲路人轻。\n决心住城中，百败望一成。\n腐草衆所弃，犹能化爲萤。\n岂我愚暗身，终久不发明。\n所悲道路长，亲爱难合幷。\n还如舟与车，奔走各异程。\n耳目甚短狭，背面若聋盲。\n安得学白日，远见君仪形。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}